{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "project-crankcase-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.58: `project-crankcase`, a PROJECT-domain run of the CRANKCASE processes, computed from the DEFAULT DATABASE plus its PROJECT input database (`inputs/washtenaw-project-crankcase.esm`). It selects source types 21 (gasoline) and 62 (diesel), road types 1, 4 and 5, and THC, CO and NOx for running exhaust, start exhaust and extended idle and for the three crankcase processes chained to them by `runspecchainedto`: crankcase running (15) to running, crankcase start (16) to start, crankcase extended idle (17) to extended idle. Its 3252 MOVESOutput rows are running exhaust and crankcase running on link 1 (road type 4) and link 2 (road type 5), start exhaust and crankcase start for both source types and extended idle and crankcase extended idle for source type 62 on the off-network link 3.\n\nWHAT IT EXERCISES: nothing PROJECT-specific beyond the parents'. CrankcaseEmissionCalculator copies each parent row at its own link and road type times `crankcaseEmissionRatio`, and neither its Java nor its SQL tests the domain, so a crankcase block is its parent's ProjectTAG activity (SHO per link, Starts and hotelling hours off-network), its parent's operating modes (the link distribution, the user's start modes, the degenerate hotelling one) and the ratio. The pre-port model already emitted all 3252 rows within tolerance; it refused the run only because `rspp_hasProjectGenerator` did not admit the nine crankcase pollutant-processes (`run_domainUnported` = 9). It is now `rspp_copiesParentRows`.\n\n`n_outputRate` IS 3252. `run_domainUnported` is 0.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "project-domain"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-crankcase/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020. The scope comes from these tables and never from the RunSpec XML, whose @key attributes are 0-based indices into sorted ID lists (docs/mixed-onroad.md §0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
